<div class="sunny"><strong>Start your day positively. Pass it on. ☀</strong><p>Jouw Lichtpuntje is a place for happy stories, sincere compliments and friendly conversations. Share what makes you smile and be kind to one another. There is no debate to win here: a smile is enough.</p><p class="small">Appreciation, encouragement and friendly questions are welcome. We do not publish attacks, rants, negative reactions to others or polarising opinions. AI reviews every comment before publication. Approved contributions are also translated into Dutch and English with AI. An administrator reviews uncertain cases. AI can make mistakes; you can request a human review of your own rejected comment in your profile.</p></div>
